# BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore; paths are relative to the build context (repo root).
# The web build needs: root manifests + lockfile, tsconfig.base.json, apps/web, apps/api/package.json (lockfile
# validation only) and deploy/web/ (Caddyfile + CSP check).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.angular
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
apps/api
!apps/api/package.json
docs
tools
scripts
deploy
!deploy/web
